WEBVTT

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.770
Starting today,
Royal Knight Commander Karasuma

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:08.690
will be teaching us the sword.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:12.990
Now, listen up: Master the sword
and you can do <i>this</i>.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.030
Wow!

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.790
That slash sliced a <i>mountain</i>!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.540
Now you try.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.660
--Yeah, right!
--Yeah, right!

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.630
That's Tadaomi Karasuma:
the most feared swordsman abroad.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.750
And this amazing swordsman
is teaching US the sword?

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.090
Lucky us!

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.220
Commander Karasuma's kinda scary,
but he sure is cool!

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.800
This could be our chance to get to know him!

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.100
Nrgh! You're trying to steal my popularity
from my students, aren't you?!

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.600
Check <i>this</i> out, class!

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.560
I'll teach you a top sword technique
that's awesomer yet!

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.980
Now <i>you</i> wield your swords just like I am!

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.030
Yeah, <i>right</i>!

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.860
And this stance also lets me unleash <i>this</i>!

00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:01.120
"The Big Bad breathed hellfire!"

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.490
Humans can't pull that off!

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:01.120
What happened to the swordwork?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.450
He's kinda dorky.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.830
Way too out there.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.620
I'd like a human teacher 
to teach us the sword.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.080
I've lost them!

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:24.220
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:33.650
"Nagisa"

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:35.320
"Karma"

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:36.320
"Kaede"

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:37.660
"Isogai" "Maehara"

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.320
"Rio" "Okuda" "Sugino" "Kanzaki"

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:41.830
"Chiba" "Hayami"

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:43.330
"Hinata" "Meg"

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:45.830
"Hinano" "Takebayashi" "Toka" "Justice"

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:47.830
"Muramatsu" "Kirara" "Yoshida" "Terasaka"

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:49.830
"Okajima" "Hara" "Mimura" "Fuwa" "Sugaya"

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:51.840
"Karasuma" "Irina"

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:08.140
"The Seductive Witch"

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:11.520
On Commander Karasuma's recommendation,

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:14.940
the crown gave us some financial support,

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.780
so we came to the village
to get ourselves equipped.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:22.530
Isn't Commander Karasuma generous,
letting us buy new equipment?

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:23.370
Right?

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:28.290
Nrrgh! My popularity with the students
is draining away to Karasuma!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.540
All we got here is some Irina Dumplings.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:33.460
Huh?

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:34.920
This <i>is</i> a weapon shop, right?

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.880
You don't have any weapons
you can recommend?

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.630
Well, I can recommend these Irina Dumplings.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.680
"Irina Dumplings" "Goddess-Soft"

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:40.510
What <i>is</i> this?

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.680
<i>What</i> is <i>this</i>?!

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:44.970
Oh, no! The armory
is only selling Irina Crackers!

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.180
And the item shop only has Irina Cakes!

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.310
Seriously?

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.350
Oh, Mistress Irina...

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.610
Irina... you're a goddess!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.570
What the heck is going on in this village?

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.610
Beats me.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.820
I give the Irina Soft-Serve four stars.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.280
What is this--an eating tour?!

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.030
I haven't been goofing around!

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:08.250
I was investigating
what's happening here in town.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.200
Huh?

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.250
Go ahead, Mr. Village Chief, sir!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:12.170
A-All right...

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.880
If this keeps up, our village is done for!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.590
Please, travelers! Drive her out...

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:26.220
Drive out Irina the Witch!

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.890
Irina the Witch?

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.900
This has the makings
of a fine extracurricular lesson!

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.440
Koro-Q!

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:34.900
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:39.490
"Tower of Temptation"

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:39.490
The Tower of Temptation? Sounds kinda seedy.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:42.820
Hello? Pardon us!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:46.780
Excuse me? Um, adventurers?

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.370
Water...

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.000
Won't you give me some water?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.580
--Way shady!
--<i>Definitely</i> do <i>not</i> give her <i>anything</i>!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.710
Take this, if you'd like.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.920
Maehara! Okajima!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.090
Oh, my--thank you!

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:06.930
I'm out.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:12.060
"Maehara was entranced!"

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.060
Maehara's been entranced!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.400
Well, <i>that</i> was easy.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.770
And you expected to drive me out, did you?

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.400
So she <i>was</i> a witch!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.190
What a knock-out!

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.030
I hate to admit it, but that's one nice body.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.610
Um... what about me?

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.240
Somehow, you're physiologically a no-go.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.780
Th-That's awful!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:32.370
Still, even a chilly reception...

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.790
...might just turn me on!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.000
"Okajima was entranced!"

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.000
How so?!

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:40.710
You must be
the seductive witch Irina Jelavich.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.840
And if I am?

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:46.050
Would you please release
the villagers from your spell?

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:50.970
Surely you jest. They'll be
my financial support until they die.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.390
But never mind that...

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:57.600
Won't <i>you</i> become my servants, too?

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:00.440
Don't be ridiculous! Seduced by a witch?

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.820
--It'll never work!
--It'll never work!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.570
Ugh, these guys...

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.900
Koro Sensei'll be fine... right?

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.250
Instakilled by boobs!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:22.500
"Koro Sensei was entranced!"

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.500
You're the worst!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:19.670
What a disappointment!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.500
How can the Big Bad be laid low by <i>boobs</i>?!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.920
Now, my servants... chase 
them on out of here.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.800
--I'll be upstairs, getting comfortable.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.470
--Chase them out...
--I'll be upstairs, getting comfortable.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.260
--Yes, chase them out...
--Oh, and...

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.060
Kayano--and the others!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:40.860
I'll take the girls for my experiments
in perfecting a charm

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.270
that'll work on women, too.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.820
Dammit! Get out of our way!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.860
Hah!

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.160
Commander Karasuma!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.410
I'll take care of this bunch!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.290
You go after the witch!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.370
Yes, sir!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:55.740
Koro-Q!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.370
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.380
"Tower of Temptation - Top Floor"

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:02.460
My goodness, men are such pushovers!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.460
So is that how you wrap them
around your little finger?

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:09.340
Obviously that kickin' bod
is being kept up with magic!

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:11.260
Are those <i>falsies</i>?!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.140
They're <i>real</i>!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.560
Tch! You brats and your big mouths!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.770
Let the girls go!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:17.730
Nagisa!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:20.230
Huh? What gives?

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:22.370
How'd you get up here?

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:26.530
Well, no matter. You can be my servants, too.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:27.700
Charm!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.990
Wh-What now, Karma?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.120
Huh!

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.620
She's been holding onto 
that pretty carefully.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.750
Figure the spell'd be 
broken if we took it back?

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.030
Urk!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.460
So what if it would?

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.090
Hit the nail on the head!

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:50.260
It's not like <i>you</i> could ever
manage to steal it away!

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:53.510
Servants! Push those two out!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:07:00.020
Now that these boys know my secret,
I can't let them leave alive.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.480
It would've been so much easier
if they'd just let me enchant them.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.940
Nagisa! Karma!

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:11.740
Little brats shouldn't stick their noses
into grown-up business.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:13.910
Farewell.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:20.750
Wha--?!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.080
Dear me, that was a close one!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.800
<i>You</i>! How'd you break my Charm spell?!

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.920
That magic never affected 
me in the first place.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.720
Who do you think I am?

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.300
I'm the Big Bad!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:38.560
As if status-effect magic
worked on the Big Bad!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.890
--Totally.
--I knew that.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.560
He's one shrewd teacher.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:49.940
But, Irina... pushing my dear students
out the window is a bridge too far.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:53.490
I'm not sure what's going on,
but don't go thinking you've beaten me!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:55.530
After all, <i>I</i> have hostages, and--eh?

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:58.620
Unfortunately for you, I've set them free.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.370
<i>What</i>?!

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.540
This one told me his strategy
back on the first floor.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.000
--I'm just pretending I'm entranced!
--What?!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.880
Commander Karasuma sliced the cage open!

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.760
Wasn't that just the <i>coolest</i>?

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.340
Oh, man, I'm head over heels!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.510
Why are they doting on <i>you</i>, Karasuma?

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.050
No fair! It was all <i>my</i> idea!

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:16.930
How should <i>I</i> know?!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.970
And sure, I may be the Big Bad and all,

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:22.140
but it sure is strange that
the spell didn't work on <i>you</i>!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.770
Are you sure you're not gay?

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.270
I'm not gay! I'm just disciplined!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.820
Now, then, Irina... are you ready?

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:34.030
You've been a naughty witch.
It's punishment time!

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:36.320
Nooo!

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.830
Stop... no!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.330
I-I'll never misbehave again.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.250
So please... forgive me...

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.460
What <i>happened</i>?!

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.430
"Okajima was entranced a second time!"

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:58.990
Are you nuts?!

00:09:52.940 --> 00:10:00.570
"Next Time: The Ruins of Tribulation"
